[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:The Boss's Letter]
[00:00.50]Lesson 45 | 第45课
[00:02.54]The boss's letter | 老板的信
[00:05.46]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答问题。
[00:11.36]Why can't Pamela type the letter? | 为什么帕梅拉不能打这封信？
[00:16.57]Can you come here a minute please, Bob? | 鲍勃，请你过来一下好吗？
[00:21.73]Yes, sir? | 好的，先生。
[00:23.36]Where's Pamela? | 帕梅拉在哪儿？
[00:26.00]She's next door. | 她在隔壁。
[00:28.06]She's in her office, sir. | 她在她的办公室，先生。
[00:30.62]Can she type this letter for me? | 她能替我打这封信吗？
[00:34.98]Ask her please. | 请你去问问她。
[00:36.58]Yes, sir. | 好的，先生。
[00:38.66]Can you type this letter for the boss please, Pamela? | 帕梅拉，请你替老板打这封信好吗？
[00:43.86]Yes, of course I can. | 好的，我当然能。
[00:47.40]Here you are. | 给你。
[00:49.14]Thank you, Bob. | 谢谢你，鲍勃。
[00:51.14]Bob! | 鲍勃！
[00:52.95]Yes? | 什么事？
[00:54.06]What's the matter? | 怎么回事？
[00:55.79]I can't type this letter. | 我打不了这封信。
[00:58.71]I can't read it! | 我看不懂！
[01:01.38]The boss's handwriting is terrible! | 老板的笔迹太糟糕了！